{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50873","headline":"省题诗二十一首 文不加点 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 文不加点","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娱宾初命赋，摛翰已堪夸。\n思发才无滞，文成点不加。\n笔端舒锦绣，手下走龙蛇。\n罢益银钩势，休添丽泽华。\n误蝇宁复见，倚马未爲嘉。\n有愧当明试，含毫到日斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}